(All three orders were valid enough for MT5 to accept. None became live positions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Why The Trades Did Not Fill) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(At placement time, the live MT5 quote for XAUUSD.vx was far below the engine's proposed entry) Tj T*
(price. The gap was too large for a short activation window.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| New York time | Order type | Engine entry | MT5 quote at placement | Approximate distance |) Tj T*
(| 2026-06-02 19:15 | SELL_LIMIT | 4517.47 | 4476.39 / 4476.72 | +41 points |) Tj T*
(| 2026-06-02 22:15 | SELL_LIMIT | 4503.77 | 4479.57 / 4479.86 | +24 points |) Tj T*
(| 2026-06-02 22:45 | BUY_STOP | 4503.27 | 4477.09 / 4477.38 | +26 points |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For a pending order to fill, market price must trade into the pending entry. These entries) Tj T*
(were not sitting near the broker's live Gold price. They were levels from a different price) Tj T*
(feed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The 10-minute cancellation behavior worked as intended. It removed stale pending orders) Tj T*
(instead of leaving old orders in the market overnight.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Root Cause) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The live runner was configured with:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Setting | Value |) Tj T*
(| TRADINGAGENTS_ANALYSIS_SYMBOL | GC=F |) Tj T*
(| TRADINGAGENTS_BROKER_SYMBOL | XAUUSD.vx |) Tj T*
(| TRADINGAGENTS_MT5_SYMBOL | XAUUSD.vx |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The deterministic engine fetched candle data for GC=F, then built exact entry, stop, and) Tj T*
(target prices from that feed. The MT5 execution path then used those exact levels on) Tj T*
(XAUUSD.vx.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(That is unsafe for live execution because futures-like Yahoo Gold pricing and the broker CFD) Tj T*
(symbol are not guaranteed to match point-for-point. The test proved they were not matching) Tj T*
(during this run.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. B+ Review) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(B+ grading was enabled during the run, but it did not affect execution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Grade | Filled candidates | Placed orders |) Tj T*
(| A_PLUS | 3 | 3 |) Tj T*
(| B_PLUS | 0 | 0 |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This is useful evidence. The B+ code path did not create low-quality trades overnight. The) Tj T*
(three orders came from A+ candidates, but they still failed to fill because the price basis) Tj T*
(was wrong.) Tj T*
ET
